  Notes (WP32): aslevel is the largest track migrated so far by chapter count — 20 chapters
  (about + 19 numbered: 11 Pure-1 + 3 Mechanics-1 + 5 Statistics-1). Confirms a2level's WP30
  additions (topicGridBlock, seeAlsoBlock, quizWidget.variant:'compact') reused MUCH more
